1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,451
Welcome.

2
00:00:00,877 --> 00:00:01,648
In this guide,

3
00:00:01,675 --> 00:00:02,805
we'll set up the Cowork

4
00:00:02,818 --> 00:00:04,161
Team Report from start to

5
00:00:04,174 --> 00:00:04,760
finish.

6
00:00:05,185 --> 00:00:06,954
It's a two-part Copilot Cowork

7
00:00:06,967 --> 00:00:08,390
solution that shows your team

8
00:00:08,403 --> 00:00:09,613
the return they're getting from

9
00:00:09,627 --> 00:00:11,528
Cowork — the hours saved and

10
00:00:11,542 --> 00:00:12,765
the dollar value of that

11
00:00:12,778 --> 00:00:14,573
time — and delivers it as

12
00:00:14,587 --> 00:00:16,076
a polished report that lands

13
00:00:16,089 --> 00:00:17,446
in everyone's inbox.

14
00:00:17,858 --> 00:00:19,081
Let's take it one step

15
00:00:19,095 --> 00:00:19,853
at a time.

16
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,163
Here's how it works.

17
00:00:22,588 --> 00:00:23,838
The team leader sets this

18
00:00:23,852 --> 00:00:25,966
up once — teammates don't do

19
00:00:25,979 --> 00:00:27,017
any of the setup.

20
00:00:27,442 --> 00:00:29,024
Each teammate simply runs the

21
00:00:29,038 --> 00:00:30,221
member skill on their own

22
00:00:30,235 --> 00:00:32,176
Cowork work, and it posts

23
00:00:32,189 --> 00:00:33,692
a short, private summary to

24
00:00:33,705 --> 00:00:35,048
one shared Team channel.

25
00:00:35,474 --> 00:00:36,524
Then the leader runs the

26
00:00:36,538 --> 00:00:38,572
manager skill, and it emails

27
00:00:38,586 --> 00:00:40,301
the team one combined report.

28
00:00:40,727 --> 00:00:42,110
It's private by design,

29
00:00:42,655 --> 00:00:43,985
so nothing is ever shown

30
00:00:43,998 --> 00:00:45,301
for any one person.

31
00:00:46,439 --> 00:00:47,676
Step one — and remember,

32
00:00:47,702 --> 00:00:48,939
everything in the setup is

33
00:00:48,952 --> 00:00:49,630
done by you,

34
00:00:49,657 --> 00:00:50,614
the team leader.

35
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,210
In Microsoft Teams,

36
00:00:52,237 --> 00:00:53,607
create a Team channel just

37
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:54,737
for these reports.

38
00:00:55,176 --> 00:00:56,293
Give it a clear name,

39
00:00:56,319 --> 00:00:57,729
add the people whose Cowork

40
00:00:57,742 --> 00:00:58,912
work you want counted,

41
00:00:59,245 --> 00:01:00,561
then copy the Team channel

42
00:01:00,575 --> 00:01:01,745
link for the next step.

43
00:01:02,879 --> 00:01:04,395
Step two — add your Team

44
00:01:04,408 --> 00:01:05,126
channel link.

45
00:01:05,552 --> 00:01:07,320
On the Installer Studio page,

46
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:08,597
paste the link into the

47
00:01:08,610 --> 00:01:09,834
box and click Build my

48
00:01:09,847 --> 00:01:10,791
install links.

49
00:01:11,217 --> 00:01:12,666
It verifies your Team channel

50
00:01:12,679 --> 00:01:13,969
right here in your browser

51
00:01:13,983 --> 00:01:14,741
and adds it to the

52
00:01:14,754 --> 00:01:16,616
skill downloads — so later,

53
00:01:16,642 --> 00:01:18,039
there's no link to paste.

54
00:01:19,169 --> 00:01:19,887
Step three.

55
00:01:20,326 --> 00:01:21,829
Back on the Installer Studio

56
00:01:21,842 --> 00:01:23,717
page, download both skills.

57
00:01:24,142 --> 00:01:24,714
There are two —

58
00:01:24,741 --> 00:01:25,672
the manager skill,

59
00:01:25,698 --> 00:01:27,094
which you install and run,

60
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,344
and the member skill,

61
00:01:28,371 --> 00:01:29,555
which your team uses.

62
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:31,523
Each already includes your Team

63
00:01:31,536 --> 00:01:32,041
channel.

64
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:34,009
You'll install the manager skill

65
00:01:34,023 --> 00:01:35,951
first — just keep the member

66
00:01:35,964 --> 00:01:37,467
skill handy for a moment.

67
00:01:38,609 --> 00:01:40,284
Now open Copilot Cowork,

68
00:01:40,710 --> 00:01:41,947
click the plus icon,

69
00:01:42,146 --> 00:01:43,795
and attach the manager skill —

70
00:01:44,074 --> 00:01:45,697
that's the team-dashboard zip.

71
00:01:46,136 --> 00:01:47,159
Don't unzip it.

72
00:01:47,585 --> 00:01:48,902
Then type the command shown

73
00:01:48,915 --> 00:01:50,670
here, or copy it from

74
00:01:50,683 --> 00:01:51,667
the setup page.

75
00:01:52,093 --> 00:01:53,130
Those words matter —

76
00:01:53,157 --> 00:01:54,167
they tell the skill to

77
00:01:54,181 --> 00:01:55,590
begin setup right away,

78
00:01:55,896 --> 00:01:57,638
including preparing the member skill

79
00:01:57,652 --> 00:01:58,556
to hand off to your

80
00:01:58,569 --> 00:01:59,048
team.

81
00:01:59,473 --> 00:02:01,109
Later, you'll schedule it to

82
00:02:01,122 --> 00:02:02,027
run a day or two

83
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,316
after your team posts.

84
00:02:04,459 --> 00:02:05,456
As part of setup,

85
00:02:05,696 --> 00:02:07,185
the manager skill offers to

86
00:02:07,198 --> 00:02:08,462
send the member skill for

87
00:02:08,475 --> 00:02:08,781
you.

88
00:02:09,206 --> 00:02:10,456
Choose Yes, and it lets

89
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:11,600
you pick your teammates and

90
00:02:11,613 --> 00:02:13,528
review the invitation before anything

91
00:02:13,541 --> 00:02:15,310
is sent — so every teammate

92
00:02:15,323 --> 00:02:16,666
gets exactly the file they

93
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,119
need.

94
00:02:18,259 --> 00:02:19,775
Here's what your teammates receive —

95
00:02:20,387 --> 00:02:21,770
an email the manager skill

96
00:02:21,783 --> 00:02:22,541
drafts for you,

97
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:24,230
with the member skill attached

98
00:02:24,243 --> 00:02:25,506
and three simple steps:

99
00:02:26,145 --> 00:02:27,674
upload the skill in Cowork,

100
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:29,150
install it, and run the

101
00:02:29,163 --> 00:02:29,948
member step.

102
00:02:30,373 --> 00:02:31,424
You just review it and

103
00:02:31,437 --> 00:02:32,169
hit send.

104
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:34,265
Step five is where it

105
00:02:34,278 --> 00:02:35,262
comes together.

106
00:02:35,689 --> 00:02:38,016
Each teammate opens Copilot Cowork,

107
00:02:38,535 --> 00:02:40,078
attaches the member skill from

108
00:02:40,091 --> 00:02:41,673
the email, and asks it

109
00:02:41,687 --> 00:02:42,551
to install.

110
00:02:42,977 --> 00:02:44,546
Cowork reviews the skill and

111
00:02:44,559 --> 00:02:45,836
confirms it's set for the

112
00:02:45,849 --> 00:02:46,886
right Team channel.

113
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:49,222
Then they run it once.

114
00:02:49,648 --> 00:02:50,831
They can prepare a single

115
00:02:50,845 --> 00:02:52,254
report to review before it

116
00:02:52,268 --> 00:02:54,010
posts, or automate it to

117
00:02:54,023 --> 00:02:55,020
run biweekly.

118
00:02:55,446 --> 00:02:56,895
Before anything posts,

119
00:02:57,201 --> 00:02:58,730
they can review their sessions

120
00:02:58,744 --> 00:03:00,539
and exclude anything personal.

121
00:03:01,689 --> 00:03:02,354
When it's ready,

122
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:03,604
the summary posts to your

123
00:03:03,617 --> 00:03:04,415
Team channel.

124
00:03:04,841 --> 00:03:06,729
It shows the expert-equivalent hours

125
00:03:06,742 --> 00:03:07,527
and their value,

126
00:03:07,553 --> 00:03:08,724
the number of sessions,

127
00:03:08,936 --> 00:03:09,880
and how well the work

128
00:03:09,894 --> 00:03:10,918
suited Cowork.

129
00:03:11,343 --> 00:03:12,739
Names and prompts are never

130
00:03:12,753 --> 00:03:13,298
shared.

131
00:03:13,724 --> 00:03:15,958
And file names become de-identified

132
00:03:15,971 --> 00:03:16,915
descriptions.

133
00:03:18,060 --> 00:03:19,535
Finally, you run the manager

134
00:03:19,548 --> 00:03:20,080
skill.

135
00:03:20,492 --> 00:03:21,822
It reads the Team channel,

136
00:03:22,035 --> 00:03:24,216
combines everyone's summaries into one

137
00:03:24,229 --> 00:03:25,665
aggregated team report,

138
00:03:26,197 --> 00:03:27,261
and emails it to your

139
00:03:27,274 --> 00:03:29,003
team as a polished newsletter.

140
00:03:29,415 --> 00:03:30,652
Set the schedule once,

141
00:03:30,679 --> 00:03:32,075
and it keeps everyone current

142
00:03:32,088 --> 00:03:34,429
automatically — with nothing to re-run

143
00:03:34,442 --> 00:03:35,200
by hand.

144
00:03:36,349 --> 00:03:37,227
So what's in the Team

145
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:37,971
Dashboard?

146
00:03:38,410 --> 00:03:39,381
Everyone gets it —

147
00:03:39,407 --> 00:03:40,923
you just open the attachment

148
00:03:40,937 --> 00:03:41,828
on that email.

149
00:03:42,253 --> 00:03:43,756
No portal, no sign-in.

150
00:03:44,181 --> 00:03:45,618
The Overview tab leads with

151
00:03:45,631 --> 00:03:46,974
the headline metrics.

152
00:03:47,413 --> 00:03:48,756
Time saved, and what it's

153
00:03:48,769 --> 00:03:49,886
worth in dollars.

154
00:03:50,312 --> 00:03:51,349
Then the team totals —

155
00:03:51,376 --> 00:03:53,596
sessions, deliverables, contributors,

156
00:03:53,623 --> 00:03:55,059
and a speed multiplier.

157
00:03:55,485 --> 00:03:56,947
These are estimates of effort

158
00:03:56,961 --> 00:03:59,115
and value, not billed time.

159
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:00,904
The Impact and

160
00:04:00,917 --> 00:04:02,327
Value tab shows where that

161
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:03,457
value came from.

162
00:04:03,883 --> 00:04:04,814
Where the time went,

163
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,130
by task category.

164
00:04:06,542 --> 00:04:07,899
The roles Cowork stood in

165
00:04:07,912 --> 00:04:08,364
for.

166
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:10,013
And the outputs your team

167
00:04:10,026 --> 00:04:10,744
produced.

168
00:04:11,889 --> 00:04:13,139
And the dashboard shows where

169
00:04:13,152 --> 00:04:14,416
Cowork is applied,

170
00:04:14,881 --> 00:04:16,583
ranked by business process.

171
00:04:17,009 --> 00:04:18,285
This is the clearest signal

172
00:04:18,299 --> 00:04:19,509
of how your team actually

173
00:04:19,522 --> 00:04:20,878
uses it — from

174
00:04:20,892 --> 00:04:22,368
Business Value and ROI

175
00:04:22,381 --> 00:04:24,283
Analytics to product development and

176
00:04:24,296 --> 00:04:26,729
customer relationships — with the hours

177
00:04:26,743 --> 00:04:27,740
saved in each one.

178
00:04:28,166 --> 00:04:29,575
And it's all aggregated.

179
00:04:30,001 --> 00:04:31,370
When fewer than three people

180
00:04:31,384 --> 00:04:32,381
used a category,

181
00:04:32,408 --> 00:04:33,538
the number is hidden —

182
00:04:33,764 --> 00:04:34,721
and no one is ever

183
00:04:34,735 --> 00:04:35,293
named.

184
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:37,556
And that's the full setup

185
00:04:37,569 --> 00:04:39,205
for the Cowork Team Report.

186
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:40,814
Create the Team channel,

187
00:04:40,841 --> 00:04:41,452
add the link,

188
00:04:41,479 --> 00:04:42,716
install the two skills,

189
00:04:42,742 --> 00:04:43,633
and let it run.

190
00:04:44,059 --> 00:04:45,614
From there, your team's Cowork

191
00:04:45,628 --> 00:04:47,317
ROI shows up in everyone's

192
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:50,056
inbox — private, aggregated,

193
00:04:50,083 --> 00:04:51,386
and always up to date.

